---
description: Service/plugin error style — assert/expect at actions; thiserror for typed errors
globs: "packages/**/{service,plugin}/**/*.rs"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Errors

- Action boundary: `assert!` / `assert_eq!` / `.expect("…")` / `.unwrap()`. Do not wrap domain `Result`s in `abort_message` helpers.
- Typed error enums: `thiserror::Error` + `#[error(...)]`. No custom `message()`; use `Display` / `to_string()`.
